const DIR={glassBg:'These colors fill the frosted glass tiles behind Registrations and At a glance, and behind the DNA section when it uses Frosted glass. Soft, light colors keep the text readable.',footer:'The columns spread evenly across the page by themselves. Address, phone, hours and the note come from Visit and contact unless you fill them in here.',glance:'Use short, true numbers. Switch the first option off to hide the whole panel.',portal:'Keep the password message: patients must come in person with their CNIC to change it.',brand:'Keep the short name under 25 characters so it fits the top bar on phones. Upload square logos and favicons.',theme:'Use a dark base color and a mid-tone accent so text stays readable. Set to default undoes any mistake.',effects:'Raise frost slowly and watch the preview. High blur can slow older phones.',views:'Finish Desktop first, then use Copy from Desktop and adjust Phone. Keep Hero first and Visit us last.',hero:'Keep the heading to 8 words or fewer. Add a full background only if the photo stays clear behind white or dark text.',trust:'Upload complete logos with some space around them, not cropped screenshots.',services:'Keep each description to one line. Switch off anything you do not offer today.',team:'Put the designation in Title, such as Child Specialist. It is the main line on the card. Everything else opens when a patient clicks.',tests:'Keep names as patients search for them. Leave a price empty to show the "ask for price" text.',gallery:'Uploads and deletions go live straight away. Use 4:3 landscape photos so the grid stays even.',holds:'Add every closed period here so patients cannot book inside it.',faq:'Write the question the way a patient would ask it, and answer in one or two sentences.',visit:'Use the phone number patients should call. Write WhatsApp as digits starting with 92.',popup:'Use one clear offer with one button. A banner of 4:3 or 16:9 looks best. Stays hidden until the first switch is on.',i18n:'Correct any phrase here. Leave a box empty to use the built-in translation.',optimize:'Run the diagnostic after big image changes. Compare Live against Previous.'};
const TIPS={'glance.value':'Keep it to about six characters, such as 24/7 or 240+.','glance.label':'Two to four words.','glance.image':'Square, 1:1. At least 200 × 200 px, clear background.','glance.columns':'4 suits up to 8 cards.','brand.logo':'Square, 1:1. At least 512 × 512 px. PNG with a clear background is best.','brand.favicon':'Square, 1:1. 512 × 512 px PNG. Keep it simple so it reads at tiny tab size.','brand.adminFavicon':'Square, 1:1. 512 × 512 px PNG. Make it different from the website icon so tabs are easy to tell apart.','hero.image':'Landscape 3:2. At least 1600 × 1067 px.','hero.images.image':'Landscape 3:2, same shape as the main hero image, so the slideshow does not jump.','hero.bgImage':'Wide 16:9. At least 2400 × 1350 px. Keep the main subject in the middle.','hero.bgImageMobile':'Tall 4:5. At least 1080 × 1350 px.','trust.image':'Square, 1:1. At least 300 × 300 px. Upload the complete logo.','services.image':'Wide 2.2:1. At least 1400 × 640 px.','team.image':'Square, 1:1. At least 600 × 600 px, with the face in the middle.','team.title':'The designation patients look for, such as Child Specialist. Shown large on the card.','team.description':'Shown only after a patient opens the card.','team.schedule':'Shown after opening the card. Example: Monday to Saturday.','gallery.image':'Landscape 4:3. At least 1600 × 1200 px. Goes live as soon as it uploads.','popup.image':'4:3 or 16:9 banner. At least 1200 px wide. The whole image is always shown.','popup.btnText':'Two or three words, such as Book now.','popup.target':'Where the button takes visitors.','popup.closeBy':'Close icon only makes sure the offer is read. Clicking outside is gentler.','popup.repeat':'A long gap avoids annoying regular visitors. Changing the popup content shows it to everyone again.','hero.title':'8 words or fewer.','hero.text':'One or two short sentences.','effects.frost':'Start around 60. Above 100 can feel heavy on older phones.','effects.glassButtons':'Off returns to solid colored buttons.','theme.siteFont':'Leave on the first choice to keep separate heading and body fonts.','optimize.quality':'0.8 is sharp and small. Below 0.65 photos may look rough.','optimize.maxWidth':'1600 px suits almost every photo here.'};
