 p.innerHTML=`<h2>Loyalty</h2><p class="psub">Only staff see these rules. Patients see just their points and badges after logging in to Reports.</p><div class="pnl glass"><h3>Loyalty rules</h3><div class="trow"><span>Loyalty points on</span>${toggle('lon',R.on)}</div><div class="vcols" style="gap:10px">${num('lpb','Points for each completed booking',R.perBooking)}${num('lpt','Extra points for each test in it',R.perTest)}${num('lrp','One extra point for every this many rupees',R.rupeesPerPoint,'0 turns this off')}</div><div class="fh" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:10px"><b>Badges and trophies (icon, name, points needed)</b><button class="btn sm ghost" id="aadd">+ Add</button></div><div id="alist" style="margin-top:8px">${aw()}</div><p class="psub">Points come from completed bookings, so a rule change recalculates every patient's total.</p><button class="btn acc sm" id="lsv">Save rules</button></div><div class="pnl glass" style="margin-top:14px"><h3>Loyalty counter</h3><input id="lq" type="search" placeholder="Search name, ID or phone" style="width:100%;min-height:42px;border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:10px;padding:0 12px;font:inherit;margin-bottom:10px"><div class="scroll" id="ll"></div></div>`;
